{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10302","headline":"送王相公赴幽州 · 皇甫曾","name":"送王相公赴幽州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"台衮兼戎律，勤忧秉化元。\n凤池东掖宠，龙节北方尊。\n长路山河转，前驱鼓角喧。\n人安布时令，地远荅君恩。\n暮日平沙迥，秋风大斾翻。\n渔阳在天末，恋别信陵门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10302.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10302","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}